.venv/

# PPMI data never belongs in git. data/ is the data folder: downloads, builds, exports and IDA pages
# (a saved IDA page holds your session key). The patterns below catch stray copies elsewhere.
/data/
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
idaSearch*.csv
*_[0-9][0-9][A-Z][a-z][a-z][0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9].csv
PPMI_Curated_Data_Cut*
*.dcm
*.nii
*.nii.gz
